<gpx version="1.1" creator="Claude Bruce Trail planner" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Day 54 - Kimberley Forest, Wodehouse Karst, Stone Foundation</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.378272" lon="-80.569282"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on 7th Line at the beginning of the Wodehouse Karst Side Trail. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.387270" lon="-80.557840"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Off road parking on private property, courtesy of the landowner, on the north side of Sideroad…. Free. Joins the route near km 2.0 (820 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.357380" lon="-80.543330"><name>P3 alternative parking</name><desc>Summer parking permitted in the main ski club parking lot, located between the two bridges on…. Free. Joins the route near km 6.3 (400 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.378363" lon="-80.556104"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn left onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.381043" lon="-80.555431"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Stone Foundation Side Trail, heading north. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.384948" lon="-80.554736"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: End of the Stone Foundation Side Trail. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.373776" lon="-80.554959"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Kimberley Forest Side Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.359542" lon="-80.545580"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turnaround point. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
